 same.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Government by others is coercive by its very nature, and it is not possible to govern others without force and threat of force. Unfortunately, most people simply don&amp;#39;t understand this and believe government does have some kind of legitimate authority to control them and their property.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;No human being (including all politicians) has the authority to initiate force against another human being, under any circumstance. Every living thing has a natural and immediate authority to defend themselves, their loved ones and their community from that initiation of force, by whatever means is necessary.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1994308768888125670/comments/default/7265390456852838939'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1994308768888125670/comments/default/7265390456852838939'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/03/merrick-garland-richard-w-roberts-and.html?showComment=1459007247147#c7265390456852838939' title=''/><author><name>MamaLiberty</name><uri>http://www.thepriceofliberty.org</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/03/merrick-garland-richard-w-roberts-and.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1994308768888125670' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1994308768888125670' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-756004747"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 26, 2016 at 9:47 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5955129553033077174</id><published>2016-03-24T15:17:59.895-06:00</published><updated>2016-03-24T15:17:59.895-06:00</updated><title type='text'>i fear those &amp;#39;protecting&amp;#39; us much more tha...</title><content type='html'>i fear those &amp;#39;protecting&amp;#39; us much more than anything else because they know the laws only apply to me, not them, no matter what they do, or fail to do.  &amp;#39;heads they win, tails they win&amp;#39; is a good summary to the &amp;#39;rule of man&amp;#39; now apparent across this nation.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;there is an evil darkness which has descended upon this land.  this will not end well.  on the other hand, as all evil officially ensconced in past times, it will end.  when?  who knows, but end it will.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;only a silly, foolish, dependent, ignorant people would allow the greatest gift of man to mankind - the notion that govt serves the people, not vice versa - to be pushed aside.    </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1994308768888125670/comments/default/5955129553033077174'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1994308768888125670/comments/default/5955129553033077174'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/03/merrick-garland-richard-w-roberts-and.html?showComment=1458854279895#c5955129553033077174' title=''/><author><name>kirk</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/03/merrick-garland-richard-w-roberts-and.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1994308768888125670' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1994308768888125670' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1377553120"